# Cloudflare Pages headers. Cross-origin isolation so SharedArrayBuffer is available and the
# JIT (E4-T29 browser executor) activates. COEP=credentialless (not require-corp) because the
# large boot artifacts live on cross-origin R2 (pub-…r2.dev) with no CORP header — credentialless
# loads cross-origin no-cors subresources without needing CORP, and keeps crossOriginIsolated true.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
